# clang-tidy exclusions consumed by scripts/run-clang-tidy-on-project.sh via
# run-clang-tidy.py's -ignore flag. Each non-comment line is an fnmatch glob
# tested against the absolute path of every translation unit in a package's
# compile database.
#
# rclcpp_components emits a node_main_<executable>.cpp entrypoint under each
# package's build/<pkg>/rclcpp_components/ directory. That source belongs to
# the upstream generator rather than to this repository, so it stays out of
# the first-party clang-tidy gate.
*/rclcpp_components/node_main_*.cpp
